        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "C[Si](C)(C)C(F)(F)F"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Note: This route uses commercially available precursors with a total cost of $1138 ($986 + $152), which exceeds the $250 budget constraint. The precursor "C=C(c1ccccc1)C1CCCC1=O" is expensive at $986/g. This is the only viable 1-step retrosynthetic route found in the database for this target molecule. The stereochemistry in the original target may require additional stereoselective conditions or starting materials with defined stereochemistry.
